'''Singapore''' is the 9th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Sumo Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

