==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6~30 seconds<sup>180f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spawn some [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] (you will need at least 3 of them out at all times). When Those Guys appear, fire the [[Cat Cannon]]. Once you have upgraded your Worker Cat to max level, you can start spamming [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] along with meatshields. This stage will be much easier if you have the [[Energy Drink]], which is unlocked by obtaining all [[Treasure]]s from the previous stages.

