==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Ehime Prefecture'''.
*Singapore's base is a statue of a [[wikipedia:Merlion|merlion]], the national symbol of Singapore.
**In [[Kumanchu Royale]], the merlion appeared as an actual enemy, [[Mr. Mer]], who would later be reimported to [[The Battle Cats]] in [[Nasi-Go-Round]].
*Ehime Prefecture's base is the bathhouse of [[wikipedia:Dōgo Onsen|Dōgo Onsen]], one of the oldest hot springs in Japan.

